          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omusaija rundi omukazi omuraguzi rundi omurogo, aitwege ateerwege amabaale, musango gwabo.”",
          "type": "text",
